e talent. As a result, she has earned the recognition of others as a reliable Operator.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":40,"base":{"hp":1144,"atk":184,"def":242,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1526,"atk":236,"def":362,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"0-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":55,"base":{"hp":1526,"atk":236,"def":362,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":2035,"atk":295,"def":490,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"0-1"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":0,"def":60}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests have shown the outlines of her internal organs to be indistinct due to abnormal shadows. Originium granules have been detected in her circulatory system, confirming her to be infected with Oripathy.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 8%\nShe presents no obvious external symptoms of Oripathy.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.21u/L\nDegree of infection is not yet severe and has not yet brought about a significant physical impact."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Though she lacks flashy skills or the capacity for Arts, Beagle uses her endurance to establish a strong forward defense for her teammates. Though a bit clumsy, she believes that everything will work out as long as she continues to press forward tenaciously. So far, she has only been proven right in this regard."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Her time in a Columbian outskirts garrison was one of the most difficult periods of her life, but also among the most precious. Beagle, along with her close companions Fang and Kroos, worked tirelessly to close the gap between them and the official team members. However, Beagle fell into a deep bout of self-loathing after being infected with Oripathy. She felt that she had become a burden on Fang and Kroos, and that it was her fault they lost everything."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"At their lowest point, Fang, Kroos, and Beagle faced expulsion and banishment from the garrison. On Kroos's recommendation, the three of them came to Rhodes Island together. On that day, Beagle resolved to repay the kindness of Fang, Kroos, and everyone who stood beside her."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"After witnessing everyone bicker, play, and express joy day after day, Beagle began to feel grateful and happy. Beagle works hard every day to solve disputes that arise between Hibiscus and Lava. She helps Fang find Kroos whenever she is slacking off. She even helps the senior members of Rhodes Island by doing chores in her free time. Time and time through and through, she enjoys every moment of her hard work."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Beagle%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Beagle%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Dreadnaught","iconPath":"/three-star-icons/Beagle%20-%20Dreadnaught.webp","fullPath":"/three-star-skins/Beagle%20-%20Dreadnaught.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Dreadnaught":"40 DC / 400 UC"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Rhodes Island","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Closure","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Closure%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"Minimum DP -4 ( -1 ) when Closure is in the squad; all [Rhodes Island] Operators ATK +4%.","matchedKeyword":"Rhodes Island"}]},{"operatorName":"Kal'tsit - Esperanta","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Kal'tsit%20-%20Esperanta%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPa