{"name":"Typhon","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"U-Official","rarity":1,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Ukusik","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Ulpianus","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Underflow","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Utage","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Valarqvin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vanilla","rarity":3,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Varkáris","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vendela","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Verdant","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vermeil","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vetochki","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigil","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigna","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vina Victoria","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Violet Mizutsune Orchid","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Virtuosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viviana","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulcan","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulpisfoglia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"W","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Waai Fu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":1,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Doctor, I'm your guard for the day! Don't worry, I won't let any sketchy people near you! Just relax!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"My training score for today...? Um, I mean, we could talk about something else...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"I can't shake the pre-battle jitters, and that makes Captain Fang really nervous too... What should I do? Doctor!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"Hibiscus and Lava always complain to me about each other, but both of them are my good friends, and neither of them are wrong... Doctor, what should I do?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"Instructor Dobermann always told us, 'Even when after you finish your training, your number one goal on the battlefield is to stay alive.' Urgh... How can I become as strong and awesome as she is?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"I'm still a rookie Operator, but I'm working hard! Hehehe, I'd really love a compliment or two, if you agree.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"My Oripathy? It doesn't bother me all that much, I'm used to it. I just want to be with the people I care about until my disease gets cured... Ughh...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"I didn't have much confidence before I came here, but I'm so glad that I can protect you and everyone on Rhodes Island! It's my dream to protect everyone! I really wish days like these could last forever.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Aww... seeing the Doctor sleeping all vulnerable like that makes me want to doodle something on a certain someone's face...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"My codename is Beagle! I know I didn't do very well on my assessment, but I'll still do my best at my internship!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"I did it! I've become stronger!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Finally, FINALLY! Now nobody's going to call me 'the Rookiest Rookie in the Rookieverse' anymore!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"I'll do all I can!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Huh? I am the leader? I don't feel right about Fang not being the leader...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Everyone, let's roll out!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Everyone, enemies incoming!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Grant me strength!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Is it my turn?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Target location reached!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"This is the place!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Haah!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Watch this!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"It's my duty to protect everyone! My resolve will never falter, no matter the odds!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"All enemies have been defeated! We Rhodes Island Operators are the finest!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Hooray, we won! Although a few enemies managed to get away... *sigh*...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"I'm sorry... so sorry...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"What can I do for you?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Doctor! Th-That tickles!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Doctor, can I come to your place to study every day?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Doctor, Happy New Year! Today's a day off, right? So that should mean we don't have to go to training... But just a minute ago, I saw Instructor Dobermann and a bunch of other operators at the training grounds. Maybe that means I should go too...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Hi, Doctor!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"D-Doctor, happy birthday! Huh? I—I'm not nervous, not at all. We got you a birthday present, so can you come visit the dorms real quick? But you'll want to be careful! And please don't tell Kroos I was the one who warned you!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"I think—what scares me more than Oripathy is the idea of separating from my friends. I love being here at Rhodes Island with everyone, and making a bunch of new friends too! As long as I keep doing what I can to get stronger, I'll be able to protect them all!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Post-Promotion Talk 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2000,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Elite Promotion 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2001,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Claire Morgan"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_122_beagle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Nana Harumura"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_122_beagle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Cheddar"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_122_beagle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Lee Hyun-jin"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_122_beagle/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}